  "body": "CI run https://github.com/yetone/magpie/actions/runs/39242954115 (b749cffbb, ubuntu Race job) failed on TestHeldClock with a data race:\n\n```\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1835286Z WARNING: DATA RACE\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1835354Z Write at 0x000004468428 by goroutine 14526:\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1835473Z   github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gateway.TestHeldClock()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1835713Z       /home/runner/work/magpie/magpie/internal/gateway/zhipu_resets_test.go:92 +0x4c4\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1835771Z   testing.tRunner()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1835963Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2036 +0x21c\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836034Z   testing.(*T).Run.gowrap1()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836201Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2101 +0x38\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836207Z \ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836291Z Previous read at 0x000004468428 by goroutine 14511:\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836350Z   time.Now()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836509Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/time/time.go:1360 +0xda\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836571Z   context.WithTimeout()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836744Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/context/context.go:704 +0x2b\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1836856Z   github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gateway.narrowWhenRead()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837024Z       /home/runner/work/magpie/magpie/internal/gateway/routing.go:470 +0xad\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837173Z   github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gateway.(*Server).restAfterMarked.gowrap1()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837343Z       /home/runner/work/magpie/magpie/internal/gateway/routing.go:925 +0x1bc\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837347Z \ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837412Z Goroutine 14526 (running) created at:\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837467Z   testing.(*T).Run()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837632Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2101 +0xb12\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837697Z   testing.runTests.func1()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837862Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2585 +0x84\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1837917Z   testing.tRunner()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1838080Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2036 +0x21c\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1838136Z   testing.runTests()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1838296Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2583 +0x9e9\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1838350Z   testing.(*M).Run()\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1838514Z       /opt/hostedtoolcache/go/1.26.8/x64/src/testing/testing.go:2443 +0xf4b\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1838623Z   github.com/yetone/magpie/internal/gateway.isolatedTests()\n--\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1841283Z WARNING: DATA RACE\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1841342Z --- FAIL: TestHeldClock (0.00s)\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:51.1841383Z FAIL\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:52.7994516Z ##[group]shard 3: ok (545 tests)\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:52.8001322Z 2026/10/19 11:23:35 refused POST /v1/messages from 203.0.113.9: not on the allow list\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:52.8001950Z 2026/10/19 11:23:35 allow list: could not read settings at /tmp/TestAllowListUnreadableSettings1244001522/002/magpie/settings.json: unexpected end of JSON input; the list read last stays in force\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:52.8002744Z 2026/10/19 11:23:35 refused POST /v1/messages from 203.0.113.9: not on the allow list\ntest (ubuntu-latest)\tRace\t2026-10-19T11:27:52.8003634Z 2026/10/19 11:23:35 allow list: could not read settings at /tmp/TestAllowListUnreadableSettings1244001522/002/magpie/settings.json: unexpected end of JSON input; only this computer is let in until it reads\n```\n\nCause: TestHeldClock (internal/gateway/zhipu_resets_test.go) assigned `time.Local` for each zone, while a goroutine an earlier gateway test left running (restAfterMarked → narrowWhenRead) called time.Now, which reads time.Local.\n\nFix: heldClock delegates to heldClockIn(t, now, loc); the test passes each zone in and never writes time.Local.\n",
